## The worlds of MR BLUE.
##
## A level is either a hand-made scene ("scene") or a list of text "chunks" that are glued
## together left to right. Every chunk is exactly 14 rows tall; one character = one 16px tile.
##
##   .  air                     #  ground              X  brick wall
##   =  bridge (one-way)        o  coin                C  crate (breaks from below)
##   ?  coin block              M  multi-coin block    F  fruit block (+1 heart)
##   R  rock block (throwing)   L  1UP block           H  platform moving sideways
##   V  platform moving up      ^  spikes              ~  lava
##   p  pinky (walker)          s  slime               u  purple slime (fast, 2 hits)
##   w  grump (throws rocks)    K  KING PINKY (boss)
##   P  start                   c  checkpoint          G  goal flag
##   T  tree   b  bush   m  mushroom                   1-9  sign showing texts[n-1]
##
## Heroes jump 2 tiles high (4 with the air jump) and clear gaps of about 4 tiles (6 running).

